    },
    {
      "_key": "k0060",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Integrating any of these tools into your work will provide invaluable support in the design process as well as ensure your designs are visually appealing and accessible to all users.",
          "_key": "k0061"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0062",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Good design is accessible design",
          "_key": "k0063"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0064",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Color contrast ratios are a fundamental aspect of accessible design. It’s crucial for designers to understand the requirements of color contrast ratios and apply suitable color contrast ratios in their work. With the right tools and a keen eye for color, designers can create visually stunning designs that are accessible to everyone.",
          "_key": "k0065"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0066",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Meet O3’s expert",
          "_key": "k0067"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0068",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Meet ",
          "_key": "k0069"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0005"
          ],
          "text": "Simone Dehel",
          "_key": "k0070"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", a certified expert in CPACC (Certified Professional in Accessibility Core) at O3. Simone is a Senior UX Designer who’s passionate about bridging the gap between accessible experiences and design. Simone is one of our leading accessibility champions at O3, is the founder of our culture club, and serves as a ",
          "_key": "k0071"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0006"
          ],
          "text": "design mentor at ADP List",
          "_key": "k0072"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Simone embodies inclusivity, making sure accessibility is not just an add-on but a core part of creating experiences.",
          "_key": "k0073"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
